                "text": "The Biden administration expanded the immigration statuses of millions of illegal immigrants to claim them as \"lawfully present\" in the US, making them eligible for Obamacare tax credits and Medicare -- including the terrorist responsible for yesterday\u2019s antisemitic attack.\n\nThe One, Big, Beautiful Bill strips federal healthcare benefits from people like this, so taxpayers aren\u2019t subsidizing healthcare for terrorists and lawbreakers.",
