                "text": "Passing the One, Big, Beautiful Bill would preserve\u2026\n\n\u2192 Over 1 MILLION manufacturing jobs\n\u2192 700,000+ retail trade jobs\n\u2192 650,000+ accommodation & food service jobs\n\u2192 630,000+ healthcare & social assistance jobs\n\u2192 580,000+ science & technology jobs\n\u2192 480,000+ waste & remediation service jobs\n\u2192 470,000 construction jobs\n\u2192 Nearly 400,000 real estate & financial service jobs\n\u2192 Over 300,000 wholesale trade jobs\n\u2192 Around 480,000 jobs from various other fields\n\nSupporting the livelihoods of millions of Americans is a no brainer.",
