                "source": "Sprout Social",
                "text": "The Democrats are doing what they do best: misleading the American people.\nWhen it comes to recently enacted changes to Medicaid, here are the facts - according to the \u201cnon-partisan\u201d CBO, which the Democrats love to cite:\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f 48% of the people who will lose Medicaid coverage are able-bodied adults who have no children and chose not to work\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f 11% are illegal immigrants who shouldn\u2019t be on the program\n\n\u27a1\ufe0f 25% are fraudsters that rob benefits from those who need them",
